------------------------------------------------
pwrapi-ref notes
1)
git clone https://github.com/pwrapi/pwrapi-ref.git

2)
sudo apt-get install hwloc mpi libtool automake make
git clone https://github.com/open-mpi/hwloc.git
cd hwloc
./autogen.sh
./configure --prefix="/home/jcorley/cap/hwloc/build/install"
make
make install

3)
cd pwrapi-ref
(remove the second line of 
./autogen.sh

4)
./configure --prefix="/home/jcorley/cap/pwrapi-ref/build/install" --with-hwloc="/home/jcorley/cap/hwloc/build/install" --enable-debug

5)
(You might have to change one variable name (gettid() to like gettsysid() at three locations in -> pwrapi-ref/src/pwr/distComm.cc )
(The variable that needs to be changed should come up in the error when you try to make it)

6)
make install
---------------------------------



